Having regard to the facts and circumstances of the case, it is hereby ordered that out of total compensation amount, the amount is disbursed as follows :
(a) Petitioner No.1/Smt. Sathiya (mother of deceased) shall be entitled to share amount of Rs.26,47,283/- (Rupees Twenty Six Lacs Forty Seven Thousand Two Hundred Eighty Three Only) alongwith proportionate interest;
(b) Petitioner No.2/Harinesh Mandal (brother of deceased) shall be entitled to share amount of Rs.66,650/- (Rupees Sixty Six Thousand Six Hundred Fifty Only)
alongwith proportionate interest;
43.

